  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The No. 1 ranker “Agaya,” the first player who reached the maximum level in the game, ‘Dungeon Story’, is in despair because his experience stats are no longer increasing. No matter which bizarre moves Agaya tries, the game quests seem too easy. Finally, Agaya thinks of a solution. \n\nI will start playing the game from scratch using another account, imitating a Newbie! \n\nWill Agaya be able to enjoy the game without others finding out who he is?\n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
